        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The maps below show an industrial area in the town of Norbiton, and planned future development of the site. Sumarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The maps below show an industrial area in the town of Norbiton, and planned future development of the site. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Sumarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Norbiton Industrial Area: Now and Future Development</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Norbiton Industrial Area: Now and Future Development y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về một khu c&ocirc;ng nghiệp ở thị trấn Norbiton v&agrave; kế hoạch ph&aacute;t triển tương lai của khu vực n&agrave;y.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Norbiton Industrial Area: Now and Future Development với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: một khu c&ocirc;ng nghiệp ở thị trấn Norbiton - kế hoạc ph&aacute;t triển trong tương lai.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Umg5dgMKLoi1spxP5bplJygTglb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FjPGdRg0woxa4GxPXCqlvAJ1gag\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&aacute;c nh&agrave; m&aacute;y hiện c&oacute; sẽ được thay thế bằng <em>c&aacute;c khu d&acirc;n cư</em> <em>(residential housing estates).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ownedaz3poOy8oxjKVklLLEpg2d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>một số <em>cơ sở hạ tầng (facilities)</em> mới bao gồm cửa h&agrave;ng, trung t&acirc;m y tế v&agrave; s&acirc;n chơi sẽ được bổ sung để <em>phục vụ cộng đồng d&acirc;n cư mới (the new residential community).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c sự thay đổi dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; <strong>về mặt địa l&yacute;</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Bố cục hiện tại (current layout)</strong></span></h4>\nTheo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R4H0dBggxox8mjxKBdNlDtg9gFS\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Đặc điểm 1)</strong> khu c&ocirc;ng nghiệp <em>nằm (be situated)</em> giữa thị trấn ở ph&iacute;a t&acirc;y v&agrave; đất n&ocirc;ng nghiệp dọc theo s&ocirc;ng ở ph&iacute;a bắc</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ah1wdzC0Jolx0GxUdKdlaVucgcd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Đặc điểm 2) </strong>khu vực n&agrave;y <em>c&oacute; m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh h&igrave;nh dạng giống ch&igrave;a kh&oacute;a (feature a key-shaped pattern)</em>, với một <em>v&ograve;ng xuyến (roundabout)</em> lớn l&agrave;m đầu v&agrave; c&aacute;c nh&agrave; m&aacute;y <em>trải d&agrave;i ra (extend out)</em> như c&aacute;c răng của ch&igrave;a kh&oacute;a.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Kế hoạch ph&aacute;t triển trong tương lai (development plan)</strong></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LKMJdE1ePoBJy3xJXC3lBK2rgre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Đặc điểm 1)</strong> khu c&ocirc;ng nghiệp n&agrave;y sẽ được chuyển đổi th&agrave;nh khu d&acirc;n cư.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SOYzdcLBFoptcxxTBZGlFFY5g1d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Đặc điểm 2)</strong> c&aacute;c nh&agrave; m&aacute;y sẽ được thay thế bằng <em>c&aacute;c khối nh&agrave; ở (housing blocks)</em>, vẫn sẽ tập trung quanh v&ograve;ng xuyến nhưng c&oacute; <em>bố cục ph&acirc;n t&aacute;n hơn (a more scattered layout)</em> so với m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh nh&agrave; m&aacute;y hiện tại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HtywdWMCpoXToexw658lmL6VgUT\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Đặc điểm 3)</strong> kế hoạch mới cũng cho thấy một v&ograve;ng xuyến thứ hai, nhỏ hơn nằm ở ph&iacute;a nam.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BFadd6z2foKzV0xJuT4lqPeKgvg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Đặc điểm 4)</strong> <em>nhiều tiện &iacute;ch (amenities)</em> sẽ được th&ecirc;m v&agrave;o, với c&aacute;c cửa h&agrave;ng v&agrave; trung t&acirc;m y tế <em>được đặt (be positioned)</em> giữa hai v&ograve;ng xuyến, v&agrave; một s&acirc;n chơi <em>được x&acirc;y dựng (be established)</em> ở khu vực ph&iacute;a đ&ocirc;ng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xnhadczsqo7V5zxiRSulnf4agGf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>(Đặc điểm 5)</strong> phần đất n&ocirc;ng nghiệp ở ph&iacute;a bắc v&agrave; thị trấn ở ph&iacute;a t&acirc;y sẽ <em>vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi (remain unchanged).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1624,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ie31dx5GUod8chxF1arlUHEPgne\">The maps compare the current industrial area of Norbiton with plans for its future development.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18136,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1625,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AYIEdQ4cDojFGzxvj9dlEYNHgte\">Overall, the most striking change is that the existing factories will be replaced by residential housing estates. Additionally, several new facilities including shops, a medical centre and a playground will be added to serve the new residential community.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18136,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1626,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XD7Cd90StoIU9zxgFeflgjyRgdh\">Looking at the current layout, the industrial area is situated between the town to the west and farmland along the river to the north. The area features a key-shaped pattern, with a large roundabout as the head and factories extending out like the teeth of a key</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18136,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1627,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KhQodNY84o4cnkxqwxSlmNz6gih\">According to the development plan, this industrial zone will be transformed into a residential area. The factories will be replaced by housing blocks, which will remain to be around the roundabout but will have a more scattered layout compared to the current factory pattern. The new plan also includes a second, smaller roundabout to the south. Furthermore, various amenities will be added, with shops and a medical centre positioned between the two roundabouts, and a playground established in the eastern section. The farmland to the north and the town to the west will remain unchanged.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18136,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
